# What Vercel does NOT need.
#
# Careful: services/, tests/ and blockchain/l3 are pnpm workspace members. Excluding them
# breaks `pnpm install` at the root, because the lockfile expects their package.json to be
# there. They stay — they are only source, and they are small.
#
# What actually made the upload 54 MB was the git history, the Foundry artifacts and the
# devnet state. Those go.

.git
.github
.devnet
.turbo
docs
infra
blockchain/contracts/lib
blockchain/contracts/out
blockchain/contracts/cache
blockchain/contracts/broadcast
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
*.log
*.tar.zst
coverage
